## Power BI Integration

### ⚠️ IN-006 Tune Power BI query parallelization (warn)
**Target:** ws-1
**Status:** fail
**Summary:** Parallelism settings at low/default values.
**Why it matters:** Default parallelism caps PBI's ability to parallelize across visuals and workers.
**How to fix:** Increase MaxParallelismPerQuery to 10+ and MaxSimultaneousEvaluations to 6+.
**Reference:** [https://learn.microsoft.com/power-bi/transform-model/desktop-storage-mode](https://learn.microsoft.com/power-bi/transform-model/desktop-storage-mode)
                <details><summary>Evidence</summary>

                ```json
                {
  "settings": [
    "MaxParallelismPerQuery=None"
  ]
}
                ```
                </details>

### ℹ️ IN-008 Use parameters for environment switching (info)
**Target:** Sales
**Status:** fail
**Summary:** No parameter found for switching connection endpoints.
**Why it matters:** Hardcoded warehouse URLs make dev → prod migration painful.
**How to fix:** Define an M parameter (e.g., 'warehouse_endpoint') and reference it in the connection string.
**Reference:** [https://learn.microsoft.com/power-bi/connect-data/desktop-dynamic-m-query-parameters](https://learn.microsoft.com/power-bi/connect-data/desktop-dynamic-m-query-parameters)
                <details><summary>Evidence</summary>

                ```json
                {
  "parameters": [],
  "heuristic": "best-effort — review and ignore if intentional"
}
                ```
                </details>

### ℹ️ IN-010 Use Publish to Power BI Service from Databricks (info)
**Target:** ws-1
**Status:** fail
**Summary:** Publish to Power BI Service not enabled.
**Why it matters:** Publish-from-UC keeps the semantic model in sync with Gold without manual refresh.
**How to fix:** Enable Publish to Power BI Service from the Unity Catalog table page.
**Reference:** [https://docs.databricks.com/integrations/configure-power-bi-online-service.html](https://docs.databricks.com/integrations/configure-power-bi-online-service.html)
                <details><summary>Evidence</summary>

                ```json
                {
  "gold_tables_visible": [
    "main.gold.fact_sales"
  ]
}
                ```
                </details>

### ℹ️ IN-011 Use Automatic Publishing from Unity Catalog (info)
**Target:** ws-1
**Status:** fail
**Summary:** 1 Gold table(s) not enrolled in Automatic Publishing.
**Why it matters:** Automatic Publishing pushes UC schema changes to Power BI without manual intervention.
**How to fix:** Enable Automatic Publishing on the Gold catalog/schema.
**Reference:** [https://docs.databricks.com/integrations/configure-power-bi-online-service.html](https://docs.databricks.com/integrations/configure-power-bi-online-service.html)
                <details><summary>Evidence</summary>

                ```json
                {
  "gold_tables_sample": [
    "main.gold.fact_sales"
  ]
}
                ```
                </details>

